  questions:
  - sentenceWithBlank: Activate the _____ cooling system.
    correctAnswer: emergency
    incorrectAnswers:
    - primary
    - pressure
    - signal
    - power
  - sentenceWithBlank: Reduce reactor _____ immediately.
    correctAnswer: power
    incorrectAnswers:
    - coolant
    - signal
    - pressure
    - doors
  - sentenceWithBlank: Increase _____ flow.
    correctAnswer: coolant
    incorrectAnswers:
    - signal
    - power
    - control
    - containment
  - sentenceWithBlank: Monitor core _____.
    correctAnswer: temperature
    incorrectAnswers:
    - signal
    - doors
    - generator
    - output
  - sentenceWithBlank: Activate the backup _____.
    correctAnswer: generator
    incorrectAnswers:
    - coolant
    - pressure
    - radio
    - containment
  - sentenceWithBlank: Restore communication _____.
    correctAnswer: signal
    incorrectAnswers:
    - power
    - coolant
    - temperature
    - generator
  - sentenceWithBlank: Begin emergency reactor _____.
    correctAnswer: shutdown
    incorrectAnswers:
    - pressure
    - coolant
    - generator
    - signal
  - sentenceWithBlank: Lock the containment _____.
    correctAnswer: doors
    incorrectAnswers:
    - signal
    - power
    - coolant
    - temperature
  - sentenceWithBlank: Pressure has reached _____ levels.
    correctAnswer: critical
    incorrectAnswers:
    - normal
    - signal
    - coolant
    - generator
  - sentenceWithBlank: Check the primary _____ system.
    correctAnswer: coolant
    incorrectAnswers:
    - radio
    - door
    - signal
    - warning
  - sentenceWithBlank: Backup power is now _____.
    correctAnswer: online
    incorrectAnswers:
    - critical
    - sealed
    - unstable
    - empty
  - sentenceWithBlank: Containment status is _____.
    correctAnswer: unstable
    incorrectAnswers:
    - online
    - coolant
    - generator
    - signal
  - sentenceWithBlank: Switch to the _____ generator.
    correctAnswer: backup
    incorrectAnswers:
    - coolant
    - pressure
    - critical
    - signal
  - sentenceWithBlank: Emergency cooling is _____.
    correctAnswer: offline
    incorrectAnswers:
    - critical
    - sealed
    - pressure
    - signal
  - sentenceWithBlank: Temperature is rising too _____.
    correctAnswer: quickly
    incorrectAnswers:
    - coolant
    - backup
    - sealed
    - signal
  - sentenceWithBlank: Maintain reactor _____.
    correctAnswer: control
    incorrectAnswers:
    - radio
    - warning
    - door
    - signal
  - sentenceWithBlank: Communication system is _____.
    correctAnswer: failing
    incorrectAnswers:
    - sealed
    - cooling
    - stable
    - generator
  - sentenceWithBlank: Warning system has been _____.
    correctAnswer: triggered
    incorrectAnswers:
    - coolant
    - generator
    - pressure
    - signal
  - sentenceWithBlank: Containment doors are _____.
    correctAnswer: sealed
    incorrectAnswers:
    - coolant
    - critical
    - generator
    - signal
  - sentenceWithBlank: Prepare for emergency _____.
    correctAnswer: shutdown
    incorrectAnswers:
    - signal
    - pressure
    - coolant
    - radio
